Implemented the student join-code enrollment slice and documented it.

What changed:
- Added student join-code domain envelopes and validation at `app/domain/classes/class-enrollment.ts:85`.
- Added bounded enrollment executor with parse-first persisted row validation at `app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/student-class-enrollment-action.ts:38`.
- Added `/join/[joinCode]` server action at `app/join/[joinCode]/actions.ts:20`.
- Updated `/join/[joinCode]` UI to render an authenticated-student enrollment form at `app/join/[joinCode]/page.tsx:26`.
- Added Supabase `join_class_by_code` RPC at `supabase/migrations/202605180001_auth_tenancy_foundation.sql:330` and grant at `supabase/migrations/202605180001_auth_tenancy_foundation.sql:456`.
- Added story evidence in `docs/stories/US-109-student-join-code-enrollment.md`.
- Updated product docs, backlog, and `docs/TEST_MATRIX.md`.

Validation passed:
- Targeted unit proof: 4 test files, 43 tests.
- `npm run typecheck`: passed.
- `npm run test:integration:auth-tenancy`: 5 passed, 1 skipped because `AUTH_TENANCY_DATABASE_URL` is not configured.
- `npm run validate:quick`: 55 test files, 541 tests.
- `npm run smoke:routes`: passed for `/`, `/login`, `/join/ALPHA01`, `/dashboard`, `/instructor/dashboard`.

No dependency install/update was run, so no audit findings surfaced. No commit, push, or PR was created. Remaining proof gaps are hosted Supabase execution, provider-backed browser E2E enrollment, local live RLS execution without `AUTH_TENANCY_DATABASE_URL`, and initial asset-holding seeding for newly enrolled funds.

